      "title": "Use scope and permission evidence",
      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Compare the caller with Principal, the operation with Action, the object ARN with Resource, and request values with Condition. A bucket ARN is not automatically the scope of an object request. A resource policy includes principal scope; it is not just an identity policy moved to another file.",
          "role": "example",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#tb4",
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#tb5"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#f1",
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#f2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Use the supplied permission evidence alongside the field matches. In a same-account request, identity and resource permissions can contribute allows, but an applicable explicit deny overrides them. For cross-account access, permission is generally required on both sides. Keep that qualification: the supplied ordinary cases are not an exhaustive account of special cases.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#tb4",
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#tb5"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.evaluate_resource_based_permissions_for_a_requested_operation#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
