          "intro": "Read the supplied bucket-policy statements and request evidence. Select one request row per judgement; compare Principal, Action, Resource and Condition before considering identity-side permission and explicit deny. These are ordinary supplied permission cases.\nBucket policy attached to the sandbox evidence bucket:\n```text\nstatement_id: same_account_read\nEffect: Allow\nPrincipal: arn:aws:iam::111111111111:role/CedarReader\nAction: s3:GetObject\nResource: arn:aws:s3:::cedar-sandbox-evidence/*\nCondition: aws:SecureTransport = true\n\nstatement_id: cross_account_read\nEffect: Allow\nPrincipal: arn:aws:iam::222222222222:role/CedarReader\nAction: s3:GetObject\nResource: arn:aws:s3:::cedar-sandbox-evidence/*\nCondition: aws:SecureTransport = true\n```",
          "tasks": [
